    "notes": "The twelve named approach and fork centerline probes cover both banks. Outer lane widths and the host-generated ramp-tail edges remain approximate. All seven detected underpass records and the source terrain and water are preserved. The deck outline and nearby ramps follow the corresponding member of OSM relation 16512008. PMTiles road traces determine the signed axis and carriageway placement. Vertical grades, concrete pier spacing and below-deck members are exterior reconstructions using ordinary photos and the standard terrain. Lane details represent the photographed configuration. At the approach forks, the host renderer supplies clipped ramp tails and pavement beyond the authored outlines. Their lateral edges depend on the host road widths and grade."
